    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d196bd9c65bb01ce347392f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天皇赏（秋）结束后・主君凯旋而归",
      "source_fingerprint": "91e096a86b42b312ee4f1263df66bd4e2f281eb5381018a8bcb24d02fd2de3c3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018315.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f96f61bc14859ad622605bf5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "女帝“气槽”，她对自己与他人都同样严格，\n但同时也很善于照顾人，\n受到许多赛马娘憧憬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bc52d32781f9ea56b78b74c62d35f860e583453ef1e55c6489ff1c133c4e507",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:634ddaac7eec9c0c96fd841d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与目标成为“赛马娘们的理想”的她\n一同挑战闪耀系列赛的日子开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97c29223eb9a61ac700a632332d72ed7fe12c73b74b0dfafa461f40bdfb8206f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79015927214d4772a806d3ad",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽登场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8246302ed9a084ef84f2c4685b9b7ed9e3e86621db1be0ddd4a3abda79aea59",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5b70f711d704620285afb60",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战结束后不久，\n气槽忙着处理学生会的业务以及照顾后辈，\n更重要的是，她也朝着自己的理想努力迈进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f687956a6df2b6339dca945d6b384c3bbd81a9c66df5eca051a0315916269c9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bc270639e4734da820c776d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在这样忙碌的日子中，\n训练员相信身为“女帝”的她，于是替她选定\n下一场适合参加的竞赛就是“阪神JF”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "194263183b9e40334ee5dea2609d2053c7fe43f0ca016749b59fa5eea6319991",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c4e3b90a0925ca98f4f7f62",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而气槽本人也希望参加“阪神JF”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66c25c0a51394ed9af53bddf538849ba75b032b1859085b292f8a072584549a6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cabdffcba608c59b6cde611e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "双方的意见一致。\n于是两人以新马级女王为目标，\n迈开步伐奔驰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1d13917ac4cc94a00d997b3fb3cf4becf3fbfcaa87ed0deebae0d9b96f616e2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb79476cafd3955b5655e649",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "化为手杖",
      "source_fingerprint": "03e3d56857cdc5aaba8f2c8eb87fce09af8059e1a0d61111f2d52d1d4811995b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dde8381607365ae3380e167e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“樱花赏”将近的某天，\n气槽看见目白多伯\n正以气势惊人的模样奋力训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b607dfed0c1745192e5483592c4a8b1a6e91337a24e84a5fdfbd240fb0d6f886",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab18be4a72b287d990af8483",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "相较于同为目白家的目白麦昆或目白赖恩，\n她觉得自己一事无成，实在很丢脸，\n因而总是训练过度。",
      "source_fingerprint": "842e44d2766e6bce05c542c283cae53f76d671a6c09544b0753ff7f830f5e2d9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87264c3a2fc17a7169fc7e99",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白多伯内心感到苦恼，\n并将自己逼到了绝境。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b871d8ea9c3673cbfd855a5f4288b18b9a6cddd0309392e2eb3e8dbbf041342",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f4e6ae56fc65c3a61edf454",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽为了引导她，\n决定要让她看自己挑战三后冠的模样，\n并向她展现何谓“理想”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e228f32335276d0f6acc1163de60c5b98f736625707ed36aae623c77e55a76de",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ca32a3eb8987f08df6f6588",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了谁的理想",
      "source_fingerprint": "49ab184de8be4e27d49df7322d8591456850e01a821360cee2a709774d069f42",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8be695ab796941901bef765a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在气槽大为活跃的同时，\n她的朋友无声铃鹿也表现突出，\n在众人间蔚为话题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f27da2e0650a3917a4821d87ea8983bbf5041ec1eb1b648d9a26cf4e6ec03a8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd6e02854e83b3236f025a7b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是气槽与她进行了模拟赛，\n并且完全输给了那被誉为\n“异次元逃亡者”的跑法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9308e99c6cacabfabebb8c155769ada94589e597431539d250af493271b09b60",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9548c91b2459babe0c3b7d3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无声铃鹿就像一堵坚固高墙阻挡在前，\n于是气槽以“打倒无声铃鹿”为目标，\n决定参加“大阪杯”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f12f62afd07061f86ea27237846d01c211cc59b85ca2448338da71ff94459ea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92d852a84d254e9ee2d7fabd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "前往彼方之人",
      "source_fingerprint": "4902916ea870f9180ff5daef5a6f5670f2fcf4abe95e33b9fc1283677b9e0e0d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f3ccf84684afa7838014faf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽对无声铃鹿的才能感到震撼，意志消沉。\n于是训练员为了让她恢复最佳状态，\n便找她出来当面谈谈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e85bd54298767edd0e09fac2e242b12fb9da3c8debf7630fd79035b0cbeccbc0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2196d291460be711e55f2863",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员告诉气槽，\n她是个为了成为所有赛马娘的“理想”\n而持续挑战的“挑战者”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "848801ebe5af3abda87cad9afac21e8c0a5ac65a2a539ceaa4cda3ed42f5280f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f6ab61e0ef2c784f75c1e88",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽更亲眼看见目白多伯正以她为“理想”，\n勤奋地持续努力，于是气槽就此清醒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "82c5fd6174367716bf9d4ff9f8b220f069a57af77cf6a20064f0066d8528d4b3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5bb1101468301f2ddc34f1c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论眼前是多么难以突破的高墙，\n都要超越它──为此，气槽重振了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cbb055f75e8401cbe5a03f18902064a137ae718f43b35dfc43c32e90e509312",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18b00ef7e7500a1e92f07e59",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "首先就是在“札幌纪念”上东山再起。\n她开始再次挑战……\n以“女帝”之姿展现“理想”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3656048a9d8b7990a252c6b3b2ab16446bc4ea6c26f58ad5b1e16312dd2aa1f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f9d045f6f7ea9a3775ecedb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你要站起来",
      "source_fingerprint": "376a2d7f19ef7ec44ff853ecf0b1ccb0b6a25b12a69991f59f3c74d9baa224f4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cbcdb390f2b777827820fd3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“天皇赏（秋）”将近的某天，\n气槽的母亲前来拜访气槽与训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2a7ad8bf6fa0771347a8efa7edc66c7370ada870e44cef2f2d462de54abc5a6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd88331775b78ed95362f193",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她非常担心性格严肃的气槽\n是不是有好好开心度日。",
      "source_fingerprint": "71645c81c6934e3d1a1ef7be80fd6e31f30b4ca42002bd32e8b98d71d47b57dc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:163d818fb11addf47cee9f74",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但看到气槽与训练员之间彼此信任的样子后，\n她因而感到放心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0c104eb1083973892fce2a566a35e8974aa579aa668b64b41578be2cf7003de",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49421e6d1f5dae577a6a87a8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是气槽与她尊敬的母亲\n度过了短暂的快乐时光，\n随后她目送母亲踏上归途。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2808a52f7078c40371d755133cfa6e4764b4e017d6cacc117bdddd0e6b78b063",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1567f81fe2713eecefd19124",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "母女",
      "source_fingerprint": "6539d2924de29d21534e46103631d012323ec01e29ebefb863486e5af3979f24",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99cceb43240bf1f983b136a4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "现在正是夏天──\n大规模的共同集训准备要开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0871e898b39f656cf72224e3ec2bc0c8cdb33154071fb0f28dbd2c32459d9d5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e43d4da37fc057a05d4c8905",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽身为学生会的成员，\n她疲于规劝兴奋玩闹的学生们，\n忙得不可开交。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0e33eeb792fdc613efbbbd371aaab182b6dae0961b6becfcd35aabac0a299e7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d824766268ad653ac154ecf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使如此，她仍坚定表示……\n为了“秋华赏”，自己绝不会疏于训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2c6fcacf9add626bef6e04ea74d3e07a78582dabb10cb8a8d28de690509dc56",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9634ab32b4bdef69ca6978ee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第2年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "225375376c5fdf8404800f01bfae8c6ed9a9204cddd553a5978ed5b2c0cbe9a7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9ebe2faffa75be4dbe49386",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“宝冢纪念”刚结束，\n紧接着迎来了“夏季集训”。\n气槽乍看下跟平常没两样，然而……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fb43177cdea7c21fb35516906d6eba2c069747d1e1fec8e93d42e09845f6237",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:076ae2658b38ae6f53150cce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她不时会露出阴郁表情，\n藏不住的沮丧全写在脸上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ee9766f71f57b768ee2de7d2f1ae3d5191d935a7e219472b20dc5590c992df2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f5f7b2d6c1b74f65b80540c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员想助气槽一臂之力。\n而鲁道夫象征也察觉了气槽的异状，\n并建议训练员好好给予气槽支持。",
      "source_fingerprint": "811027e7fcda994886245eb5aba8e11c716f2b5b12b90a3503fdbc02ccc336e4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72058bac4a14af9aec8b7e3c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "受鼓舞的训练员展开行动，\n为了让气槽借“札幌纪念”的机会\n重获自信，希望她能就此复活。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83fbc27d142cc738ecf9efd5d9c4c8a0e37ef420a01d5606625d3ebd16395ce0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7d22d645b61eed460dbbe50",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第3年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2018daecd587b3acd573214a2b2c9e4607f1262610f0ce7cb9324e673d98a91d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d927b8d8355b74076ac24d6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c47fcae25bdeab47b79863f9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“出道战”当天，\n气槽收到了目白多伯的一番加油鼓励。",
